# Android build + signing. None of these may ever be committed:
# `.claude/rules/project.md` §7 and `.claude/rules/security.md` §1.
**/android/.gradle/
**/android/local.properties
# Both names are listed on purpose. The local release build reads
# `keystore.properties` from `apps/pos/android/`, and the Flutter docs use
# `key.properties` — a file that leaks a keystore is not the place to be tidy.
**/android/keystore.properties
**/android/key.properties
**/*.jks
**/*.keystore
.env

